Introduction:
So esentially this is a finite state machine, on some Automata shit... Anyways
Instead of thinking it as a river and a boat the program sees it as a state, like for example
one side has 3 of this and so on and so forth. Anyways everytime th player makes a move the program runs that move through the logic
or filters we made.
1. Capacity check, thats the if else statement we made trying to see if the move fits in the boat
2. Availability check, this checks if the side actually has people to give or move
3. Survival check, this is thee final check to see if the game has already ended, also ask if they want to play again.